      {
        "body": "Historical observation before the queue work was completed: backlog grew during the evening peak and cleared overnight; consumer count was fixed. The user reports the queue work is now done. The settled approach is repartitioning by the higher-cardinality key, with autoscaling off. This observation is retained as diagnostic history, not an unresolved queue work item.",
