    {
      "body": "State: The user reports the queue work is done. The settled decision is to repartition by the higher-cardinality key; consumer autoscaling stays off for this queue.\nReasoning: Evening traffic concentrated on one partition. Scaling consumers helped briefly, then increased contention on that partition. Repartitioning addresses the partition-key bottleneck.\nBlockers: No queue blockers are recorded. Other project notes contain unresolved items, but their relationship to the queue is not established and their status has not been changed.\nNext concrete step: Hand the completed queue work and linked diagnostic history to the incoming owner. No further queue action was requested; deployment or post-change validation details were not supplied.",
